Mike Albaugh's notes on gcc-1.40:

to configure for use on our systems (all targets)

	ln config/xm-i386v.h ./config.h

then for each target:

Native:
	ln config/tm-i386sco.h	./tm.h
	ln config/out-i386.c	./aux-output.c
	ln config/i386.md	./md

Motorola 68000 cross-compiler:
	ln config/tm-mac68k.h	./tm.h
	ln config/out-m68k.c	./aux-output.c
	ln config/m68k.md	./md

ASAP cross-compiler:
	ln config/tm-asap.h	./tm.h
	ln config/out-asap.c	./aux-output.c
	ln config/asap.md	./md


